 font-size: 24pt;\">」</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 24pt;\">해외연수 프로그램 안내</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:155%;text-align:center;word-break:keep-all;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:95%;letter-spacing:-0.5pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:20.0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 155%; text-align: left; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">LINC3.0 사업단에서는 학생들의 해외연수를 통하여 글로벌 마인드 함양 및 해외 기술 동향을 접해 볼 수 있는 기회를 제공하고자하오니 적극적인 지원바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:155%;text-align:center;word-break:keep-all;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:95%;letter-spacing:-0.5pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:20.0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 155%; text-align: left; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">○&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;\">참여대상: LINC3.0 참여학과 3, 4학년 재학생&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 155%; text-align: left; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;\">&nbsp; ※ 수리빅데이터학과, 휴학생, 2023년 2월 졸업예정자 제외</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 155%; text-align: left; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:95%;letter-spacing:-0.5pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:20.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, Appl